<title>JAPAN: Yamaha Corp -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Yamaha Corp -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		207.05		vs	  190.93</p>
<p> Operating	   10.51		vs	   13.21</p>
<p> Current	     11.41		vs	   10.67</p>
<p> Net		    5.80		vs	    5.73</p>
<p> EPS		   29.90 yen	  vs	   29.51 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    194 million	  vs	 194 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.00 yen	  vs	    3.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Yamaha Corp is a major manufacturer of musical instruments.</p>
